<title>SPAIN: Iberdrola H1 net profit up 18.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Iberdrola H1 net profit up 18.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for electricity group Iberdrola six months to June in billions of pesetas, unless stated:</p>
<p>					  H1 1996	 H1 1995</p>
<p> Net taxed			    48.685     up 18.2 pct</p>
<p> Operating profit		  116.522     up  7.2 pct</p>
